// The `core/csv` conformance package.
//
// RFC 4180 is a page long and almost all of it is about quoting, so that is
// what these cases are: a delimiter inside quotes, a newline inside quotes, a
// doubled quote, and a quote that never closes. The two errors are asserted by
// value, because a record index in a message is the only thing that makes a
// bad file findable.
